EAST BAY FOUNDERS - EVENT REMINDER

Hi all, a reminder that the Founder Breakfast is tomorrow, Friday March 20, at 8:00am at the Temescal space (the storefront on Telegraph with the green door; the code is in the portal).

We are at 24 RSVPs for 25 seats, so if you are on the list and cannot make it, please release your spot today; there are six people on the waitlist.

Format, such as it is: coffee and pastries from the bakery two doors down, a round of thirty-second intros at 8:15am, and then conversation until people drift off to work around 9:30am. No slides, no pitching, no agenda. If you have a specific ask (an intro, a hire, a question about a vendor), say it in your thirty seconds; that is what the room is for.

Street parking on Telegraph is metered from 8am; the lot behind the space has eight spots and is first come. The 6 bus stops outside.

If you have a dietary restriction we do not know about, reply today and we will make sure there is something you can eat.

See you in the morning.

